sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant W as Lark widget
  participant G as Lark gateway
  participant V as Video YT MCP
  participant Y as YouTube
  U->>W: types a query in the Video panel
  W->>G: callTool video-yt__search with query
  G->>G: proxy handler forwards through its backend session
  G->>V: session callTool search
  V-->>G: numbered plain text list of results
  G->>G: formatBackendResult passes text through
  G-->>W: text result
  W->>W: parseSearchResults extracts title channel and video id
  W->>Y: loads thumbnails from i.ytimg.com
  U->>W: taps a result
  W->>G: callTool video-yt__play with video id
  G->>V: session callTool play
  V-->>G: ok
  W->>Y: embeds youtube.com embed iframe with autoplay
